===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*ǵʰers-}}
First attested in 1449, from {{inh|en|enm|abhorren}}, borrowed from {{der|en|frm|abhorrer}}, from {{der|en|la|abhorreō||shrink away from in horror}}, from {{prefix|la|ab|gloss1=from|horreō|gloss2=stand aghast, bristle with fear|nocat=1}}.<ref>{{R:CDOE|page=2}}</ref>

